0/extras/d967922cfaa4cf5a7726bb7cc5ead0bf.poster.avif?t=1726452479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150820/extras/d967922cfaa4cf5a7726bb7cc5ead0bf.webm?t=1726452479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150820/extras/d967922cfaa4cf5a7726bb7cc5ead0bf.mp4?t=1726452479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Crafting And Gathering</strong> - Gather resources and craft various items and equipment to assist in farming and combat.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150820/extras/cc2b5131049cac0df43fc5d23554e464.poster.avif?t=1726452479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150820/extras/cc2b5131049cac0df43fc5d23554e464.webm?t=1726452479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150820/extras/cc2b5131049cac0df43fc5d23554e464.mp4?t=1726452479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Build and Upgrade</strong> - Build and upgrade farm buildings to house more creatures, plant more crops, and increase your living space.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150820/extras/88ffbff24a9ae788eff5564607492c26.poster.avif?t=1726452479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150820/extras/88ffbff24a9ae788eff5564607492c26.webm?t=1726452479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150820/extras/88ffbff24a9ae788eff5564607492c26.mp4?t=1726452479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
